!
! How many pixels of a row lie in lo..hi, both ends counted, in Trebago
! (gesso_rules.h GR4): each pixel counts 1 when 1 + px - lo and 1 + hi - px
! are both at least 1, else 0. One lo and one hi for the whole row: two of
! either are refused here, where KRON sums them: held. Exact.
trebago pixel_range_count
  in  px(n), lo, hi
  out count
  count = sum(i, max(0, min(1, 1 + px(i) - lo)) * max(0, min(1, 1 + hi - px(i))))
end
